#~ msgid ""
#~ "The timer will continue running until"
#~ " you stop it manually. You can "
#~ "see your active timer on the "
#~ "dashboard and timer page. The timer "
#~ "persists even if you close your "
#~ "browser or restart your device. If "
#~ "idle detection is enabled, the timer "
#~ "may pause automatically after the "
#~ "configured timeout period."
